      "latest_changelog": "<h1 data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"90\">Changelog</h1>\r\n<h2 data-start=\"92\" data-end=\"115\">[1.2.2] &ndash; 2025-09-18</h2>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"116\" data-end=\"125\">Added</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<li data-start=\"126\" data-end=\"344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"155\"><strong data-start=\"128\" data-end=\"155\">Entity logging commands</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"344\">\r\n<li data-start=\"158\" data-end=\"244\">\r\n<p data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"244\"><code data-start=\"160\" data-end=\"172\">/entitylog</code> &mdash; persistance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"247\" data-end=\"344\">\r\n<p data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"344\"><code data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"261\">/blockloge</code> &mdash; exact-block alias (only entity interactions <strong data-start=\"308\" data-end=\"314\">at</strong> the block you&rsquo;re looking at).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"372\"><strong data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"372\">Search &amp; filter flags</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n<li data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"447\">\r\n<p data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"447\"><code data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"388\">-s &lt;text&gt;</code>: show only lines that contain <code data-start=\"419\" data-end=\"427\">&lt;text&gt;</code> (case-insensitive).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"539\"><code data-start=\"452\" data-end=\"462\">-t &lt;tag&gt;</code>: show only lines with the tag (e.g. <code data-start=\"499\" data-end=\"506\">block</code>, <code data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"514\">item</code>, <code data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"527\">container</code>, <code data-start=\"529\" data-end=\"537\">entity</code>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"540\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"576\"><strong data-start=\"542\" data-end=\"576\">Radius &amp; count across commands</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<li data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"645\">\r\n<p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"645\"><code data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"589\">-r &lt;R&gt;</code> for radius (blocks). Default for entity scans is <strong data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"644\">3</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"694\">\r\n<p data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"694\"><code data-start=\"650\" data-end=\"658\">-n &lt;N&gt;</code> to cap lines returned (up to 2000).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"779\">\r\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"779\"><strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"719\">Tags on every line</strong> for easy grepping: <strong data-start=\"739\" data-end=\"778\">[BLOCK] [ITEM] [CONTAINER] [ENTITY]</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"780\" data-end=\"873\">\r\n<p data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"873\"><strong data-start=\"782\" data-end=\"802\">Safer help texts</strong> (<code data-start=\"804\" data-end=\"820\">/blocklog help</code>, <code data-start=\"822\" data-end=\"839\">/entitylog help</code>) that don&rsquo;t break chat rendering.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"897\">Changed / Improved</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<li data-start=\"898\" data-end=\"961\">\r\n<p data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"961\"><strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"928\">Per-block history buffer</strong> default raised to <strong data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"954\">500</strong> lines.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1085\">\r\n<p data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"1085\"><strong data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"983\">Output ordering</strong>: results are printed <strong data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1024\">oldest &rarr; newest</strong> so the latest line appears <strong data-start=\"1052\" data-end=\"1060\">last</strong> (chronological reading).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1086\" data-end=\"1186\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1186\"><strong data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1113\">HUD-style coordinates</strong> in chat (<code data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1136\">X/Z +dx/+dz</code>) with <code data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1156\">[abs x,y,z]</code> embedded for precise lookups.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1307\"><strong data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1208\">Container names</strong>: interactions say the actual container name (e.g., &ldquo;opened <strong data-start=\"1268\" data-end=\"1277\">crate</strong>&rdquo;) instead of generic &ldquo;block&rdquo;.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1386\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1386\"><strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1329\">Held-item names</strong>: better retrieval for the item used during interactions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1387\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1403\"><strong data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1403\">Command UX</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1406\" data-end=\"1481\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1481\"><code data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1427\">/blocklog up|down</code> checks the block <strong data-start=\"1445\" data-end=\"1480\">above/below the looked-at block</strong>.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1585\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1585\">Flags can be given in any order and combined (e.g., <code data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1583\">/blocklog -r 5 -s crate -t container -n 100</code>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1587\" data-end=\"1596\">Fixed</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1666\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1666\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1619\">Month off-by-one</strong> in in-game timestamps (now using <code data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1664\">Month + 1</code>).</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1667\" data-end=\"1763\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1763\"><strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1687\">Chat stability</strong>: help output no longer breaks chat; long outputs are chunked to safe sizes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1764\" data-end=\"1848\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1848\"><strong data-start=\"1766\" data-end=\"1790\">&ldquo;Too many arguments&rdquo;</strong> and parsing glitches when mixing flags/positional values.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1850\" data-end=\"1865\">Performance</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1866\" data-end=\"1962\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1962\"><strong data-start=\"1868\" data-end=\"1888\">Batched file I/O</strong>: log lines are queued and flushed once per second to avoid thread stalls.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"2055\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2055\"><strong data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"1982\">Spatial index</strong> for radius queries (16&times;16 XZ cells) to reduce scan cost on large worlds.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2166\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2166\"><strong data-start=\"2058\" data-end=\"2083\">Merge-newest strategy</strong> for radius results: collects newest per-position then trims, minimizing sort work.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2167\" data-end=\"2242\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2242\"><strong data-start=\"2169\" data-end=\"2197\">Exact-block entity alias</strong> (<code data-start=\"2199\" data-end=\"2211\">/blockloge</code>) avoids radius scans entirely.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>",
      "is_symlink": false
    },
